scene 空屋
source p0001
@bg room/dusk fade 1.5
@fg cg-window
@show traveler/coat/calm left
@move left center
traveler as 访客: {whisper}是这里吗？{/whisper}{wait .6}{speed 0.5}我{ruby ま}等{/ruby}。{/speed} cont #a3f9
@caption 夜幕
@shake strong 0.4
@caption 窗外 wait
@zoom center 1.08 1.0 ease-out
@particle rain 0.4 1 -25
@mask vignette strength .7
@camera sway
@filter sepia .4
@cg cg-window
@wait

scene 风过
source p0002-p0002
@bg duration .5 room/night
@face traveler/sly
traveler (inner): {wave}风声{/wave}像是从墙里传出。 {{？}
@costume traveler/cloak
@face traveler/calm
@wait 0.2
@hide traveler
@fg none
@cg none
@particle none
@filter none
@mask none
: 屋子静了。
@camera reset
